  "solution": "**Given**\n\n⇒ (x - 5)2 = 5x + 11\n\n**Calculation**\n\n⇒ (x - 5)2 = 5x + 11\n\n⇒x2- 10x + 25 = 5x + 11\n\n⇒x2- 10x + 25 - 5x - 11 = 0\n\n⇒x2- 15x + 14 = 0 \n\n⇒x2- 14x - x + 14 = 0 \n\n⇒x(x-14) - 1(x-14) = 0\n\n⇒(x-14) (x-1)=0\n\n⇒ x= 14 or x = 1\n\nHence,** The of Given equation are 1 and 14.**",
